            7. Conditional Operators Commonly Used:-

                Conditional statements commonly use comparison operators to check conditions.

                | Operator | Meaning                  | Example  | Result |
                |----------|--------------------------|----------|--------|
                | ==       | Equal to                 | 10 == 10 | True   |
                | !=       | Not equal to             | 10 != 5  | True   |
